-- A parse error caused by a RESOLVED ditto names the copied token:
-- "unexpected ^ (resolved to PLUS)" — not the bare "unexpected ^" that
-- once blamed the caret (SET-OPERATORS-SPEC §17.3 bookmark). The caret
-- below column-aligns with PLUS on the line above, so it resolves to
-- PLUS, which cannot start an expression.
one MEANS 1 PLUS 2
huh MEANS   ^
